<title>USA: RightChoice Managed Care Inc Q4 net loss.</title>
<headline>RightChoice Managed Care Inc Q4 net loss.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.20   profit	 $0.26</p>
<p> Net loss		   3,680   profit	 4,917</p>
<p> Revs		     170,239		  154,605</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  18,676		   18,681</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.11   profit	 $1.26</p>
<p> Net loss		   2,027   profit	23,570</p>
<p> Revs		     653,375		  591,880</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  18,678		   18,687</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 includes one-time pre-tax charge of $1.3 million for expenses related to relocation of customer service operations, which brings total one-time pre-tax relocation charges to $4.5 million for 1996.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
